===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|kirche}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|chirihha}}, an early borrowing from {{etyl|grc|de}} {{m|grc|κυριακόν}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|kerk}}, English {{m|en|church}}.

